                     CONTRIBUTION GUIDELINES
- it's a beautiful thing to see something i care about cared
  for by others
- for style just like copy what's already there (or don't im
  not your mom just make sure it's readable and doesn't have
  too much whitespace, i want to see all my stuff in one spot)
- if you open a pr to main from a fork horrible things might
  happen to you
- if you want to help but aren't familiar with the project
  then pick an issue labeled 'easy probably' (its the vomit
  brown colored one)
- keep things on the right branches
- ask before solving problems that aren't there (only i'm
  allowed to do that)
- it should be easy to create content for rat game. every
  format for configuration or assets should have a plaintext
  option or an in-house tool to work with it
- clean up src/assets.hpp